0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"刚刚出现的那是……难道是传说中的……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1620734002:0":{"key":"say:5:1620734002:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620734002","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"没错，是湖中精灵！如此神秘，美丽，优雅的生灵，据说只会...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1620734003:0":{"key":"say:6:1620734003:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620734003","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我已经追踪湖中精灵很久了，第一次有这样难得的机会能亲眼...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1620734004:0":{"key":"say:7:1620734004:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620734004","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"今天真是太刺激了！原本只是想去旁听娑丽丝老师的课，结果...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1620734005:0":{"key":"say:8:1620734005:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620734005","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"简直就像变成了冒险小说的主人公一样！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1620734006:0":{"key":"say:9:1620734006:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620734006","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"皮帕，你的混沌魔法太了不起了！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:10:1620734007:0":{"key":"say:10:1620734007:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620734007","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"嘿嘿，谢谢……不对！我是想提醒你，不要再使用混沌魔法了……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1620734008:0":{"key":"say:11:1620734008:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620734008","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你想一想，如果那只飞行魔物不是那么温顺，你的处境岂不是...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:12:1620734009:0":{"key":"say:12:1620734009:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620734009","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"……你的担心也不是没有道理，别担心，我使用的时候会加倍...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:14:1620734010:0":{"key":"say:14:1620734010:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"14","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620734010","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"布里奇特离开后，皮帕担忧地叹了一口气。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:15:1620734011:0":{"key":"say:15:1620734011:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"15","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620734011","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"梅林大人，我怎么觉得布里奇特一点不觉得害怕，反而还很满...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:16:1620734012:0":{"key":"say:16:1620734012:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"16","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620734012","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"刚刚那个进入画中的女孩也是……难保他们不会再次使用混沌魔法。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:17:1620734013:1":{"key":"say:17:1620734013:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"17","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1620734013","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"对了！娑丽丝老师！我惹了这么大的麻烦还没有跟娑丽丝老师...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","doc